Description: Enterprise-grade R package scaffolding, CI/CD pipelines, and
    development standards for scientific research teams. Implements the MPI
    Handoff Blueprint architecture — pure functional interfaces, deterministic
    environments, stochastic test-driven development (STDD), and automated
    quality gates. Designed to bridge the gap between academic research code
    and production-grade reproducible analysis packages.
